  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups whole milk",
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted",
    "3 eggs, beaten",
    "2 tablespoons light brown sugar",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "10 slices hearty farmhouse-style bread, toasted and cut into cubes",
    "1 cup raisins",
    "1.25 cups whole milk",
    "0.5 cup light brown sugar",
    "2 tablespoons butter, melted",
    "1 egg",
    "1 tablespoon all-purpose flour",
    "1 pinch ground cinnamon",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a 2-quart baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LgoVjmcCTlw1E3BdtSUleViot3g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217181-best-bread-pudding-with-vanilla-sauce-ddmfs-Step-01-f5b6ea4e211a45d8934ae05cabbd1715.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217181/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "For bread pudding, whisk together milk, sugar, melted butter, eggs, brown sugar, and cinnamon in a mixing bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ntRIZHR4TmwoPjSFOddEMzeGilw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217181-best-bread-pudding-with-vanilla-sauce-ddmfs-Step-02-de166fda2dff4569a9b6e8c651133cc5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217181/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently stir in bread cubes and raisins.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YcX6PQcRL5--Sn3l1GtYbUG_iz8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217181-best-bread-pudding-with-vanilla-sauce-ddmfs-Step-03-859e37f9e1d24a6391f36d5f6cb5ac68.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217181/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly spoon mixture into the prepared baking dish. Bake in the preheated oven until browned and set in the middle, 50 to 55 minutes; cover the dish with foil after 30 minutes to prevent excessive browning. Let pudding stand for 10 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gmuiXWiemjQ2aO9gL0TCsH-yIAY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217181-best-bread-pudding-with-vanilla-sauce-ddmfs-Step-04-25020517d15f421dabe2056e6ae30944.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217181/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "For vanilla sauce, whisk together milk, brown sugar, butter, egg, flour, cinnamon, and salt in a heavy saucepan until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9K5deDo0tvRXoc1-rsV4YiayU3k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217181-best-bread-pudding-with-vanilla-sauce-ddmfs-Step-05-c575b968c96b49f88671c19f98c06259.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217181/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook over medium heat, whisking constantly, until sauce is thickened and coats the back of a spoon, 10 to 12 minutes. Stir in vanilla extract.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/S5MDu86niApqO_p6YYPoRdTymto=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217181-best-bread-pudding-with-vanilla-sauce-ddmfs-Step-06-e1637a93f0bb4ad7b0c767e60bae8646.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217181/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour sauce over warm bread pudding or serve on the side in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k6y2yfMspATEIFSp5TcdoH47EJc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217181-best-bread-pudding-with-vanilla-sauce-ddmfs-4x3-3bc10a5bac1a4d398ab2a6ba4814818f.jpg"
      ],
